          "type": "trust",
          "settings": {
            "custom_icon_1": "shopify://shop_images/return_exchange_1.gif",
            "title_1": "Return and Exchange",
            "content_1": "<p><strong>A 7-day, no-questions-asked return and exchange policy.</strong></p><p>Just ensure that the product is unused and all tags are intact.</p><p><strong>Please use following link to process Return & Exchange: </strong></p><p><a href=\"https://baccabucci.clickpost.ai/return-exchange\" title=\"https://baccabucci.clickpost.ai/return-exchange\">https://baccabucci.clickpost.ai/return-exchange</a></p>",
            "custom_icon_2": "shopify://shop_images/Customer_1.gif",
            "title_2": "Customer Service",
            "content_2": "<p><strong>Contact Us:</strong></p><p>Bacca Bucci Fashions Pvt. Ltd.<br/>G-152, Old No 87/88, Village Gazipur, Near MCD School, Delhi-110096</p><p><a href=\"mailto:crm@baccabucci.com\">crm@baccabucci.com</a></p><p><a href=\"tel:+91 82-877-31376\">Tel. +91 82-877-31376</a></p><p>Hours: Mon to Sat from 10 AM to 6 PM</p>",
            "custom_icon_3": "shopify://shop_images/delivery_1.gif",
            "title_3": "Shipping and Delivery",
            "content_3": "<p>All of our orders are delivered by our top courier partners. Most of our orders are shipped out within a day, and most deliveries happen within a couple of days. However, for J&K and the North East region, it may take 3–7 days. </p><p><strong>Please use following link to Track your order: </strong></p><p><a href=\"https://baccabucci.clickpost.ai/\" title=\"https://baccabucci.clickpost.ai/\">https://baccabucci.clickpost.ai/</a></p>",
            "custom_icon_4": "shopify://shop_images/manufacturing_details_1.gif",
            "title_4": "Manufacturer Details",
            "content_4": "<p><strong>Manufactured & Marketed By:</strong></p><p>Bacca Bucci Fashions Pvt. Ltd.<br/>G-152, Old No 87/88, Village Gazipur, Near MCD School, Delhi-110096</p><p><strong>Country of Origin: </strong></p><p>India</p>",
            "custom_icon_5": "shopify://shop_images/warranty_1.gif",
            "title_5": "Warranty",
            "content_5": "<p>Bacca Bucci offers a warranty on its products against manufacturing defects. The warranty period and terms may vary depending on the specific product purchased. <strong>Typically, the warranty period for Bacca Bucci shoes is one month from the date of purchase.</strong></p><p>During the warranty period, we will repair or replace the defective product at no charge, provided that the defect is not a result of normal wear and tear, misuse, or abuse of the product. The warranty does not cover accidental damage or damage caused by improper use or care of the product.</p><p>To claim warranty service, customers need to email us the order number and image of the defective product at <strong>crm@baccabucci.com</strong>. Upon receiving the package, our customer care executive will inspect the product and determine whether it is covered under warranty. If the defect is covered under warranty, we will provide a repair or replacement according to the terms of the warranty.</p>"
          }
        }
